# Local rasen run state and throwaway probes.
.rasen/

# Agent tooling installed into this checkout, not project content: rasen mirrors
# the same workflow skills into both directories on every install.
.claude/
.omp/

# A separate Git repository with its own remote, holding planning artifacts.
# Ignored here so it can never be staged into this repository by accident.
/rasen/

# AGENTS.md is a tracked symlink to CLAUDE.md, so both agent tool families read
# one file and cannot drift. The global ignore excludes AGENTS.md as tooling
# noise; in this repository it is content, so the exclusion is reversed here.
!AGENTS.md
